{"ref":"BDB, צָהֹב","hw":"צָהֹב","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">צָהֹב</span></big>  <strong>adj. gleaming, yellow</strong> (of hair);—<span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׂעָר צ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:30\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.30\">Lv 13:30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:32\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.32\">32</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:36\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.36\">36</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳ שָׁחֹר</span> v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:31\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.31\">31</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:37\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.37\">37</a>).","next":"BDB, צָהַל","prev":"BDB, צָהֵב"}